; --average-lot-prices shows each commodity's lots as one lot at their
; average price.  When every lot an account holds has a fixated price,
; {=price} (here from buying at `@ =price`), the average is fixated too,
; since none of those prices is a market price: -V values Assets:Same's
; 4 ETF {=EUR10} and Assets:Spread's 4 ETF {=EUR11} at those prices, EUR40
; and EUR44, as it values the lots themselves (EUR20 + EUR24 for
; Assets:Spread), and not at the market price of EUR12.  One floating lot
; among them makes the average floating, so -V values all of Assets:Mixed
; at EUR12, and so do units that have no price at all, like the gift in
; Assets:Unpriced: they dilute the average (EUR5 a unit), and a fixated
; average would value them at nothing.  A lot sold off entirely is no
; holding and does not count against the fixation
; (lot-average-fixated-zero.test).
;
; Ledger used to drop the fixation when averaging, and kept it only when
; the average price and the earliest lot's date happened to be those of a
; fixated lot, as for Assets:Same and Assets:Mixed here: lots fixed at
; different prices, as in Assets:Spread, averaged to a floating price that
; -V revalued at the market.

2024/01/01 Buy
    Assets:Same      2 ETF @ =EUR10
    Assets:Cash

2024/02/01 Buy
    Assets:Same      2 ETF @ =EUR10
    Assets:Cash

2024/01/02 Buy
    Assets:Spread    2 ETF @ =EUR10
    Assets:Cash

2024/02/02 Buy
    Assets:Spread    2 ETF @ =EUR12
    Assets:Cash

2024/01/03 Buy
    Assets:Mixed     2 ETF @ =EUR10
    Assets:Cash

2024/02/03 Buy
    Assets:Mixed     2 ETF @ EUR10
    Assets:Cash

2024/01/04 Buy
    Assets:Unpriced  2 ETF @ =EUR10
    Assets:Cash

2024/02/04 Gift
    Assets:Unpriced  2 ETF
    Income:Gift

P 2024/03/01 ETF EUR12

test bal --average-lot-prices --flat --no-total Unpriced
        4 ETF {EUR5}  Assets:Unpriced
end test

test bal --average-lot-prices -V --flat --no-total Unpriced
               EUR48  Assets:Unpriced
end test

test bal --average-lot-prices --flat --no-total Same Spread Mixed
       4 ETF {EUR10}  Assets:Mixed
      4 ETF {=EUR10}  Assets:Same
      4 ETF {=EUR11}  Assets:Spread
end test

test bal --average-lot-prices -V --flat --no-total Same Spread Mixed
               EUR48  Assets:Mixed
               EUR40  Assets:Same
               EUR44  Assets:Spread
end test
